## Technology Stack

### Backend (NestJS)

| Category | Technology |
|---|---|
| Framework | NestJS ^10.0.0 |
| ORM | Prisma ^5.10.0 |
| Database | PostgreSQL 16 (Docker) |
| Auth | @nestjs/jwt + @nestjs/passport + passport-jwt |
| Upload | Multer (images/videos) |
| Validation | class-validator + class-transformer |
| API Docs | @nestjs/swagger |
| Realtime | WebSocket Gateway (@nestjs/websockets + socket.io) |

### Frontend (Flutter)

| Category | Technology |
|---|---|
| Framework | Flutter ^3.9.0 |
| State | flutter_bloc ^8.1.4 |
| DI | get_it + injectable |
| Network | dio ^5.4.1 + retrofit ^4.1.0 |
| Models | freezed_annotation + json_annotation |
| Code Gen | build_runner + freezed + json_serializable + retrofit_generator + injectable_generator |
| Navigation | go_router ^13.2.0 |
| Storage | shared_preferences + flutter_secure_storage |
| UI | google_fonts, cached_network_image, shimmer, lottie, flutter_svg |
| Media | image_picker, video_player, video_compress |
| i18n | flutter_localizations + intl |
| Realtime | socket_io_client (for chat) |

