## Project Structure

### Backend (`backend/`)

```
backend/
├── docker-compose.yml
├── package.json
├── prisma/
│   └── schema.prisma
└── src/
    ├── main.ts
    ├── app.module.ts
    ├── auth/           # JWT auth, login, register, refresh
    ├── users/          # Profile CRUD, search, avatar/cover upload
    ├── posts/          # Create/delete/list posts, like/unlike
    ├── comments/       # CRUD comments on posts
    ├── stories/        # Create/list/delete stories, mark viewed
    ├── follow/         # Follow/unfollow, list followers/following
    ├── chat/           # WebSocket gateway, conversations, messages
    ├── notifications/  # CRUD notifications
    ├── upload/         # Multer file upload (images/videos)
    ├── common/         # Guards, decorators, filters, pipes
    └── prisma/         # PrismaService
```

### Frontend (`app/lib/`)

```
lib/
├── main.dart
├── core/
│   ├── constants/        # AppConstants (baseUrl, keys)
│   ├── network/          # DioClient (token refresh interceptor)
│   ├── di/               # GetIt + Injectable setup
│   ├── router/           # GoRouter + AuthNotifier
│   ├── theme/            # AppTheme, ThemeNotifier
│   ├── l10n/             # LocaleProvider
│   ├── utils/            # ErrorMapper, Validators
│   └── widgets/          # Shared widgets (buttons, inputs, avatar)
├── features/
│   ├── auth/             # Login, Register, ForgotPassword
│   ├── feed/             # Feed screen (posts + stories bar)
│   ├── post/             # Create/detail post, PostCard widget
│   ├── story/            # Create/view stories
│   ├── search/           # User search
│   ├── profile/          # View/edit profile, followers list
│   ├── follow/           # Follow BLoC + repository
│   ├── chat/             # Chat list + chat room (socket.io)
│   ├── notifications/    # Notification list
│   ├── onboarding/       # Splash + onboarding
│   └── settings/         # Theme toggle, language, logout
└── l10n/
    ├── app_en.arb
    └── app_vi.arb
```

Each feature follows E-commerce pattern:
```
feature/
├── bloc/           # BLoC + Events + States
├── data/
│   ├── datasources/  # Retrofit API service
│   └── repositories/ # Repository impl
├── domain/
│   ├── models/       # Freezed models
│   ├── repositories/ # Abstract repository
│   └── usecases/     # UseCase classes
└── presentation/
    ├── pages/
    └── widgets/
```

