## Database Schema (Prisma)

```prisma
// ==================== ENUMS ====================
enum MediaType {
  TEXT
  IMAGE
  VIDEO
}

enum NotificationType {
  LIKE
  COMMENT
  FOLLOW
  MENTION
  MESSAGE
}

// ==================== MODELS ====================
model User {
  id              String         @id @default(uuid())
  email           String         @unique
  password        String
  name            String
  username        String         @unique
  bio             String?
  avatar          String?
  coverPhoto      String?
  followersCount  Int            @default(0)
  followingCount  Int            @default(0)
  postsCount      Int            @default(0)
  isVerified      Boolean        @default(false)
  posts           Post[]
  comments        Comment[]
  stories         Story[]
  likes           Like[]
  sentMessages    Message[]      @relation("sender")
  conversations1  Conversation[] @relation("participant1")
  conversations2  Conversation[] @relation("participant2")
  followers       Follow[]       @relation("following")
  following       Follow[]       @relation("follower")
  notifications   Notification[]
  storyViews      StoryView[]
  createdAt       DateTime       @default(now())
  updatedAt       DateTime       @updatedAt
}

model Post {
  id                String    @id @default(uuid())
  authorId          String
  author            User      @relation(fields: [authorId], references: [id])
  content           String
  imageUrls         String[]
  videoUrl          String?
  videoThumbnailUrl String?
  mediaType         MediaType @default(TEXT)
  likesCount        Int       @default(0)
  commentsCount     Int       @default(0)
  sharesCount       Int       @default(0)
  likes             Like[]
  comments          Comment[]
  createdAt         DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt         DateTime  @updatedAt
}

model Comment {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  postId    String
  post      Post     @relation(fields: [postId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  authorId  String
  author    User     @relation(fields: [authorId], references: [id])
  content   String
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
}

model Like {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  postId    String
  post      Post     @relation(fields: [postId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  userId    String
  user      User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  @@unique([postId, userId])
}

model Story {
  id        String      @id @default(uuid())
  authorId  String
  author    User        @relation(fields: [authorId], references: [id])
  mediaUrl  String
  mediaType MediaType
  caption   String?
  viewCount Int         @default(0)
  views     StoryView[]
  expiresAt DateTime
  createdAt DateTime    @default(now())
}

model StoryView {
  id       String   @id @default(uuid())
  storyId  String
  story    Story    @relation(fields: [storyId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  viewerId String
  viewer   User     @relation(fields: [viewerId], references: [id])
  viewedAt DateTime @default(now())

  @@unique([storyId, viewerId])
}

model Follow {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  followerId  String
  follower    User     @relation("follower", fields: [followerId], references: [id])
  followingId String
  following   User     @relation("following", fields: [followingId], references: [id])
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())

  @@unique([followerId, followingId])
}

model Conversation {
  id             String    @id @default(uuid())
  participant1Id String
  participant2Id String
  participant1   User      @relation("participant1", fields: [participant1Id], references: [id])
  participant2   User      @relation("participant2", fields: [participant2Id], references: [id])
  lastMessage    String?
  lastMessageAt  DateTime?
  messages       Message[]
  createdAt      DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt      DateTime  @updatedAt

  @@unique([participant1Id, participant2Id])
}

model Message {
  id             String       @id @default(uuid())
  conversationId String
  conversation   Conversation @relation(fields: [conversationId], references: [id])
  senderId       String
  sender         User         @relation("sender", fields: [senderId], references: [id])
  content        String
  imageUrl       String?
  isRead         Boolean      @default(false)
  createdAt      DateTime     @default(now())
}

model Notification {
  id         String           @id @default(uuid())
  userId     String
  user       User             @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])
  type       NotificationType
  title      String
  body       String
  data       Json?
  isRead     Boolean          @default(false)
  createdAt  DateTime         @default(now())
}
```

---

## Backend API Endpoints

### Auth
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/auth/register` | Register (email, password, name, username) |
| POST | `/auth/login` | Login → accessToken + refreshToken |
| POST | `/auth/refresh` | Refresh token |
| POST | `/auth/forgot-password` | Send reset email |

### Users
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/users/me` | Current user profile |
| GET | `/users/:id` | Get user by ID |
| PATCH | `/users/me` | Update profile |
| POST | `/users/me/avatar` | Upload avatar |
| POST | `/users/me/cover` | Upload cover photo |
| GET | `/users/search?q=` | Search users |

### Posts
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/posts` | Feed (paginated, newest first) |
| GET | `/posts/user/:userId` | User's posts |
| GET | `/posts/:id` | Post detail |
| POST | `/posts` | Create post (multipart: content + files) |
| DELETE | `/posts/:id` | Delete own post |
| POST | `/posts/:id/like` | Toggle like |
| GET | `/posts/:id/like-status` | Check if liked |

### Comments
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/posts/:postId/comments` | List comments |
| POST | `/posts/:postId/comments` | Add comment |
| DELETE | `/comments/:id` | Delete own comment |

### Stories
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/stories` | Active stories (grouped by user) |
| POST | `/stories` | Create story (multipart) |
| POST | `/stories/:id/view` | Mark as viewed |
| DELETE | `/stories/:id` | Delete own story |

### Follow
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/follow/:userId` | Follow user |
| DELETE | `/follow/:userId` | Unfollow user |
| GET | `/follow/:userId/status` | Check follow status |
| GET | `/users/:userId/followers` | List followers |
| GET | `/users/:userId/following` | List following |

### Chat
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/conversations` | My conversations |
| POST | `/conversations/:userId` | Get/create conversation |
| GET | `/conversations/:id/messages` | Messages (paginated) |
| **WebSocket** | `chat` gateway | Send/receive messages realtime |

### Notifications
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/notifications` | My notifications |
| PATCH | `/notifications/:id/read` | Mark as read |
| PATCH | `/notifications/read-all` | Mark all as read |

---

## Phased Development Plan

### Phase 1: Project Setup (Day 1–2)
- Flutter project init at `c:\Mobile\Social_media`
- Backend NestJS init with Prisma + PostgreSQL Docker
- Clone core patterns from E-commerce: DioClient, DI, Router, Theme, i18n, ErrorMapper
- Shared widgets library

### Phase 2: Authentication (Day 3–4)
- Backend: Auth module (register, login, JWT, refresh token)
- Frontend: AuthBloc, LoginPage, RegisterPage, ForgotPasswordPage
- Same patterns as E-commerce (UseCases, AuthRepository, GoRouter redirect)

### Phase 3: User Profile (Day 5–7)
- Backend: Users module (CRUD, avatar/cover upload)
- Frontend: ProfileBloc, ProfilePage, EditProfilePage

### Phase 4: Post & Feed System (Day 8–12) ⭐
- Backend: Posts + Comments + Likes modules (multipart upload for images/video)
- Frontend: FeedBloc, PostBloc, CommentBloc
- Screens: FeedScreen, CreatePostScreen, PostDetailScreen
- Widgets: PostCard, ImageGrid, VideoPlayerWidget

### Phase 4.5: Story System (Day 13–15)
- Backend: Stories module (auto-expire query, view tracking)
- Frontend: StoryBloc, CreateStoryScreen, StoryViewerScreen
- Widgets: StoryCircle (gradient ring), StoryProgressBar

### Phase 5: Follow & Search (Day 16–18)
- Backend: Follow module (atomic follow/unfollow with count update)
- Frontend: FollowBloc, SearchBloc, FollowersPage, SearchPage

### Phase 6: Real-time Messaging (Day 19–22)
- Backend: Chat WebSocket gateway + conversations module
- Frontend: ChatBloc with socket_io_client, ChatListPage, ChatRoomPage

### Phase 7: Notifications & Polish (Day 23–27)
- Backend: Notifications module (triggered on like/comment/follow)
- Frontend: NotificationBloc, NotificationsPage
- Polish: Shimmer loading, animations, empty states, error states

---

## Verification Plan

### Automated
```bash
# Backend
cd backend && npm run start:dev
npx prisma studio  # Visual DB inspection

# Frontend
flutter test
flutter run
```

### Manual
- Auth flow: Register → Login → Token refresh → Logout
- Post flow: Create (text/image/video) → Feed → Like → Comment → Delete
- Story flow: Create → View → Auto-expire after 24h
- Follow flow: Search → Follow → Check counts → Unfollow
- Chat flow: Open conversation → Send message → Realtime receive
- i18n: Switch Vi ↔ En, verify all strings
- Theme: Toggle dark/light mode
